    <description>Screen Flow for customers to upload transaction receipts/invoices via a Salesforce Site URL. Accepts customerId as URL parameter. AI analyzes the image, validates it as a transaction document, finds the matching transaction, and files a dispute automatically. Part of the TruZentra Banking Assistant.</description>
